defmodule Solution do
  @doc """
  Checks whether two given strings are anagrams.

  Ignores spaces and is case-insensitive.
  Time complexity is O(n log n) due to sorting.

  ## Examples

      iex> Solution.anagram_checker("listen", "silent")
